@anchor{entry}
@chapter Ledger entry

The ledger entry represents a double-entry accounting item placed in an immutable and signed chain.


@section Accounting items

An entry consists of @emph{debit} and @emph{credit} items, at least one of each.

The sum of all debit and credit items must be zero. A @emph{debit} item used here to define a @emph{spend}, where the @emph{credit} item is used to define @emph{receipt}.

Please @xref{accounts,Accounts} for details on how to interpret the values for each item.


